  └── minimax_music3_dav.safetensors\n```\n\n## 反馈问题\n\n注意：请先更新 ComfyUI（[指南](https://docs.comfy.org/installation/update_comfyui)）并准备好所需模型。桌面版/云端版遵循稳定版的更新节奏，因此部分仅夜间版支持的模型可能还不可用。\n\n- 无法运行 / 运行时错误：[ComfyUI/issues](https://github.com/comfyanonymous/ComfyUI/issues)\n- UI / 前端问题：[ComfyUI_frontend/issues](https://github.com/Comfy-Org/ComfyUI_frontend/issues)\n- 工作流问题：[workflow_templates/issues](https://github.com/Comfy-Org/workflow_templates/issues)"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [440, 680], "pos": [2143.37939453125, 188.05426025390625], "id": 40, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 6}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["## MiniMax Music 3\n\n一款由 MiniMax 开发的音乐生成模型，能够创作结构稳定、音质出色的完整歌曲，最长可达 5 分钟。驱动它的输入有两项：**Caption（音乐描述）**（结构化的音乐描述：风格、情绪、人声、编曲）和 **Lyrics（歌词）**（通过 `[intro]`、`[verse]`、`[chorus]`、`[bridge]`、`[outro]` 等标签控制歌曲结构）。\n\n### 参数说明\n\n| 参数 | 说明 |\n|---|---|\n| Caption | 音乐描述。建议按三个部分来写——全局元信息 → 人声细节 → 编曲。写得越具体，结果越接近预期。 |\n| Lyrics | 歌曲歌词 + 段落标签。标签是唯一可执行的曲式指令；歌词文本本身只传达情绪。 |\n| max_duration | 目标歌曲时长（秒），默认 120（2 分钟）；模型最长支持约 300 秒（5 分钟）。歌曲越长，耗时和显存占用越大。 |\n| seed | 生成所用的随机种子。固定种子可复现同一首歌曲；更换种子可获得不同的版本。 |\n| 模型文件 | 扩散模型 / 文本编码器 / VAE。 |\n| Tiled decode | 以分块（重叠瓦片）方式解码音频 VAE，大幅降低显存占用——对低显存 GPU 生成较长歌曲很有帮助。速度略慢，且分块边界处有小概率出现接缝；高显存 GPU 上建议关闭以获得最佳质量。 |\n\n### 提示词编写指南\n\n官方 [Music Caption Rewriter Skill 可在这里找到](https://github.com/MiniMax-AI/MiniMax-Music3)"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "title": "Note: MiniMax Music 3", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [520, 660], "pos": [2616.494140625, 190.78106689453125], "id": 39, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 7}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "FLOAT", "links": [81], "label": "FLOAT", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "FLOAT"}], "size": [270, 58], "pos": [604.2852172851562, 487.1409606933594], "widgets_values": [60], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "value"}], "flags": {}, "id": 61, "type": "PrimitiveFloat", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveFloat"}, "order": 8}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "string", "links": [82], "label": "string", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "string"}], "size": [400, 200], "pos": [918.6864013671875, 492.0873718261719], "widgets_values": ["A bright and uplifting 120bpm summer marching anthem song, featuring emotional, clear female vocal with gentle vibrato and powerful belting, about a joyful parade walking through sunlit golden streets lined with blooming flowers and children playing, filled with warm, nostalgic, and energetic atmosphere, with acoustic guitar, electric guitar, piano, brass section, and polished production with lush reverb and analog warmth.\n"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "id": 59, "type": "Text", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "Text"}, "order": 9}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "string", "links": [83], "label": "string", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "string"}], "size": [400, 200], "pos": [1356.218994140625, 492.1722106933594], "widgets_values": ["\n[Intro]\n(Synth shimmer and light percussion build up)\n\n[Verse]\n阳光洒在肩头 微风轻轻吹过\n金色的麦浪 在田野里跳跃\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n脚步不再沉重 梦想开始飞翔\n听见心跳节奏 和着夏日乐章\n\n[Chorus]\n夏天进行曲 奏响希望旋律\nOh yeah 脚步轻盈 走向明天去\n夏天进行曲 唤醒心中活力\nWoah 让爱传递 在每个呼吸里\n\n[Bridge]\n汗水与泪水 都是成长的印记\n每一步向前 都不再犹豫\n\n[Chorus]\n夏天进行曲 奏响希望旋律\nOh yeah 脚步轻盈 走向明天去\n夏天进行曲 唤醒心中活力\nWoah 让爱传递 在每个呼吸里\n\n[Outro]\n(Fading out with bright synth and soft claps)\n夏天进行曲... 永远不停息"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "id": 60, "type": "Text", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "Text"}, "order": 10}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#ffc214", "inputs": [],